          "date": "2026-11-11 18:47:54.000000000",
          "tz": 60
        },
        "subject": "LU-12669 ec: tidy the checks for reads that wait for OSTs",
        "message": "LU-12669 ec: tidy the checks for reads that wait for OSTs\n\nll_file_io_generic() keeps the read that waits for the stripes' OSTs\nfrom falling back to CIT_EC_RD by clearing io->ci_cross_ec before the\nDIO fallback check.  Test ec_wait in that check instead, so that\nci_cross_ec keeps its meaning for the whole IO.\n\nlov_io_ec_rd_start() prints a console warning with rc = -EIO when a\nraid set has more unavailable stripes than parity, although the read\nthen waits for the OSTs.  Since waiting is not an error, print a debug\nmessage instead.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I559a1254a696a33a5052e3bb214be10a0841c754\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
